Package: connection-manager
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: MLTech <duncan@mltech.co.uk>
Depends: freerdp3-x11 | freerdp2-x11, putty, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1
Suggests: rustdesk
Installed-Size: __SIZE__
Homepage: https://connection-manager.lloydstechnical.com/
Description: Shared remote connections (RDP, Web, PuTTY, RustDesk)
 Connection Manager keeps one shared list of remote connections on the
 Connection Manager Server, so every Windows and Ubuntu PC that signs in
 sees the same list. Opens Remote Desktop (FreeRDP), web pages, PuTTY (SSH)
 and RustDesk connections with one click.
